# EasyExcel 导入导出规范

## 导入（读取）

### 使用 ReadListener 模式

**禁止一次性加载全部数据到内存**，必须使用监听器模式：

```java
EasyExcel.read(inputStream, UserInfoImportRequest.class, new UserInfoExcelListener(userService))
    .headRowNumber(2)
    .sheet(0)
    .doRead();
```

### 监听器模板

```java
public class XxxExcelListener extends AnalysisEventListener<XxxImportDTO> {

    private final IXxxService xxxService;
    private final List<XxxImportDTO> dataList = new ArrayList<>();
    private static final int BATCH_SIZE = 500;

    public XxxExcelListener(IXxxService xxxService) {
        this.xxxService = xxxService;
    }

    @Override
    public void invoke(XxxImportDTO data, AnalysisContext context) {
        dataList.add(data);
        if (dataList.size() >= BATCH_SIZE) {
            xxxService.batchImport(dataList);
            dataList.clear();
        }
    }

    @Override
    public void doAfterAllAnalysed(AnalysisContext context) {
        if (CollUtil.isNotEmpty(dataList)) {
            xxxService.batchImport(dataList);
            dataList.clear();
        }
    }
}
```

## 导出（写入）

### 导出 VO 定义

放在 `vo/` 包下，使用 `@ExcelProperty` 注解：

```java
@Data
public class XxxExportVO {
    @ExcelProperty("姓名")
    private String name;

    @ExcelProperty("手机号")
    private String phone;

    @ExcelProperty("创建时间")
    @DateTimeFormat("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss")
    private LocalDateTime createTime;
}
```

### 单 Sheet 导出

```java
@PostMapping("/export")
public void export(HttpServletResponse response, XxxQuery query) throws IOException {
    response.setContentType("application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet");
    response.setCharacterEncoding("utf-8");
    String fileName = URLEncoder.encode("导出数据", "UTF-8");
    response.setHeader("Content-disposition", "attachment;filename=" + fileName + ".xlsx");

    List<XxxExportVO> list = xxxService.selectExportList(query);
    EasyExcel.write(response.getOutputStream(), XxxExportVO.class)
        .sheet("数据")
        .doWrite(list);
}
```

### 多 Sheet 导出

```java
ExcelWriter excelWriter = EasyExcel.write(response.getOutputStream()).build();
try {
    WriteSheet sheet1 = EasyExcel.writerSheet(0, "Sheet1").head(Vo1.class).build();
    excelWriter.write(data1, sheet1);

    WriteSheet sheet2 = EasyExcel.writerSheet(1, "Sheet2").head(Vo2.class).build();
    excelWriter.write(data2, sheet2);
} finally {
    excelWriter.finish();
}
```

## 大数据量导出

超过 10000 条数据时，使用分批写入避免内存溢出。
